WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Proof Case 009. Northwind Dental Studio — a new vertical, a new founder path.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The front door asks who you are before it asks what to build.
Startup founder. A page to test demand.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The wizard reads dental clinic, Calgary, appointment requests —
and drafts a plan before you sign up.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Account created. The workspace opens clean.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:40.000
You type the full combined ask to your front person:
a landing page for Northwind Dental Studio,
and the automation that catches every appointment request.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
One send. The cockpit shows the hire in the open.
The ticker runs. The team works in view.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
After about three minutes.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:04.000
The page is live — services, team, and the booking form at a public address.
Customer delivered. Preview ready.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Same session. The automation lane seals a verified workflow file in Files.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Page and workflow from one founder sentence — front door through workspace to delivery.
Edited live session on production.
